s=json.loads((D/'source.json').read_text());qs=s['record'][':knowledge-point/questions'];lines=['# Classification\n\nDatabase math, basis 1356, lineage '+s['lineage']+'. The copied source is immutable evidence. The source set contains 14 practice questions, all moderate; the canonical e-6173 is context, not a fifteenth practice question.\n\nEvery source has one selection radio field with five text choices and exactly one correct designation. Prompts ask which of three mutually exclusive statements are true; the five choices name subsets of Roman-numbered statements. Bullet and Roman-number layouts are distinct preserved source presentations. There are no checkbox or blank fields and no mathematical plots. The canonical SVGs are typeset mathematics, not plotted geometry.\n\nThirteen conservative Markdown/value families retain fourteen exact replay aliases/component masks. q-74637 and q-74643 share one family: dimensions, bullet layout, swap plus three additions, zero-row removal and explicit substitution sequence agree; coefficient forms are parameters/conditional term formatting. Their complete banks differ and remain separate profiles. Other families preserve genuinely different layouts, dimensions, fixed prose or ordered solution-stage sequences. Changed numbers never count as a new family. Six complete observed bank profiles are shared across these families. The full mapping is in `families.json`.\n\n| Replay alias/source | Dimensions | Class | Operations | Statement layout | Profile | Plots |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|']
